(7761037, 1285503, 83313, '<td valign="top">I recall many drives across the old Tappan Zee when I was a kid, but I don''t live there anymore and haven''t been across this new one. I''ll be about 10 miles from it next week for work. Is there a good perspective from the banks? Although it appears there may be a ped/bike lane on this new bridge to get out on it. Maybe worth a short drive if I have the time.</td>', 'I recall many drives across the old Tappan Zee when I was a kid, but I don''t live there anymore and haven''t been across this new one. I''ll be about 10 miles from it next week for work. Is there a good perspective from the banks? Although it appears there may be a ped/bike lane on this new bridge to get out on it. Maybe worth a short drive if I have the time.', '2023-12-14 23:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
